[
  {
    "comment": "IT之家 每日签到（App 接口 napi.ithome.com）。\n\n变量 cookie_jwtuser 的取值方式：\n① 推荐：点下方「从 QianDao Cookie Extractor 获取」，只读取 jwtuser 这一条 Cookie 的原始值（不读取其它 Cookie，也不需要 User-Agent；HttpOnly 的 Cookie 一样能读到）。\n② 手动：在浏览器登录 www.ithome.com 后，用开发者工具或本项目的 Cookie 提取扩展复制 cookie「jwtuser」的原始值，原样粘贴 —— 不要解码，也不要再自己拼 Bearer，前缀已经写在模板 URL 里了。\n\n签到结果会写在任务日志里；重复执行只会回复「今日已签到」，不会重复领金币。Cookie 有效期约 30 天，过期后重新取一次即可。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://napi.ithome.com/api/usersign/sign?userHash=Bearer%20{{cookie_jwtuser}}",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "*/*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-Hans-CN;q=1, en-US;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "ITHomeClient/9.32 (iPhone; iOS 18.3.2; Scale/3.00)"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": []
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\"ok\":(0|1)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^(4|5)\\d\\d$",
          "from": "status"
        },
        {
          "re": "未登录|请先登录|登录已过期|凭证",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
